# Nothing generated on an instance belongs in the repository.
#
# The real environment file lives at /etc/worood-hub/api.env and is generated
# by ec2-bootstrap.sh. If a copy ever appears in this directory, it is a
# mistake — and these rules mean it is a mistake that does not become a commit.

*.env
!deploy.env
!env/*.env.example

*.pem
*.key
*.dump
*.sql.gz
bootstrap.log
release-*.log
